ype 1 (TS) motif. Individual members of this family differ in the number of C-terminal TS motifs, and some have unique C-terminal domains. The encoded preproprotein is proteolytically processed to generate the mature enzyme. Expression of this gene may be regulated by the cytokine TNF-alpha. [provided by RefSeq, Mar 2016].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[],"uniprot_source":null,"retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}